{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t本港今早天氣顯著轉涼，截至上午5時30分，天文台錄得最低氣溫15.3度，是入秋以來的最低紀錄。<br/>\n<br/>\n天文台說，一股強烈東北季候風及一道雲雨帶正影響廣東沿岸。預測今日密雲，有幾陣雨。日間市區氣溫介乎14至16度，新界再低一兩度，新界部分地區及高地寒冷。吹清勁北至東北風，離岸及高地吹強風。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯︰張萬燕\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T23:04:20.252698+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T22:27:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T04:57:32.600860+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T22:57:49.100537+00:00","content_hash":"68b74e28c3358873046835ab7a829e24a56e5bf63ad0d1c673a0c7d43b064ae4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}